rapping-mul-i128, wrapping-mul-u128, wrapping-neg-i128, wrapping-neg-u128, wrapping-shl-i128, wrapping-shl-u128, wrapping-shr-i128, wrapping-shr-u128, wrapping-sub-i128, wrapping-sub-u128, wrapping-u128-to-i128, wrapping-u128-to-i16, wrapping-u128-to-i32, wrapping-u128-to-i64, wrapping-u128-to-i8, wrapping-u128-to-isize, wrapping-u128-to-u128, wrapping-u128-to-u16, wrapping-u128-to-u32, wrapping-u128-to-u64, wrapping-u128-to-u8, wrapping-u128-to-usize, wrapping-u16-to-i128, wrapping-u16-to-u128, wrapping-u32-to-i128, wrapping-u32-to-u128, wrapping-u64-to-i128, wrapping-u64-to-u128, wrapping-u8-to-i128, wrapping-u8-to-u128, wrapping-usize-to-i128, wrapping-usize-to-u128

